{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1485397-tc-aether-serial","id":1485397,"title":"TC: Aether serial","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aether"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-30T11:16:34-07:00","id":1485397,"title":"TC: Aether serial","content":"In the tradition of Victorian serial storytelling, <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/i-from-the-depths-of-space-to-the-heart-of-london/\" target=\"_blank\">Part I</a> of an official Aether serial from the Onyx Path blog.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-30T22:13:19-07:00","id":1485452,"title":"","content":"From first episode of 'serial'...<br /> <br /> <i>Anne</i> Mercer? Mysterious J\u2014\u2014\u2014? What is going on here? \ud83d\ude32","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-01T00:41:23-07:00","id":1485459,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Maxwell Mercer\u2019s parents were both anthropologists and fueled Max\u2019s curiosity and desire to know more. Dr. Richard Mercer regaled his son with stories about a secret society he once belonged to, called the Esoteric Order of the \u00c6ons, and his mother, Anne Mercer, filled him tales of exploration, adventure, and mischief. </div> </div> </div>From Adventure! Manuscript\u2026 I guess it\u2019s no spoiler that Anne and Richard are Max parents\u2026<br /> <br /> Now, J\u2014\u2014\u2014 is a real mistery\u2026 I have a few ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-01T04:13:09-07:00","id":1485482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1485397-tc-aether-serial?p=1485459#post1485459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From Adventure! Manuscript\u2026 I guess it\u2019s no spoiler that Anne and Richard are Max parents\u2026<br /> <br /> Now, J\u2014\u2014\u2014 is a real mistery\u2026 I have a few ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>What are your ideas?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-01T10:36:33-07:00","id":1485520,"title":"","content":"Jekyll was the first name at my mind, but it\u2019s a surname.<br /> James Moriarty maybe\u2026<br /> Jack Tallon, aka Safari Jack, is known to them for sure and it\u2019s already in the universe.<br /> <br /> I said I have ideas, not they are good\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-01T12:34:28-07:00","id":1485532,"title":"","content":"Since they made J--- a mystery it is probably a name whose revelation should surprise us.<br /> <br /> Is he a real life person? A fictional character appropriate for these epoch? Or perhaps a character already mentioned in another Trinityverse product?<br /> <br /> A crazy idea: <br /> There is one very infamous person living in these times whose name starts with J and whose alliance with the Mercers would be absolutely shocking: Jack the Ripper...<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4081-thomas-weinbrenner","name":"Thomas Weinbrenner","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-03T03:47:23-07:00","id":1485685,"title":"","content":"James, Jack, Joseph...ordinary names wouldn't be surprising- there are lots of Josephs and Jacks and James. <br /> <br /> My money's on &quot;Jules&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","name":"Shalmaneser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-03T07:09:12-07:00","id":1485688,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s a J with three dashes, which means it\u2019s probably a four letter name. I\u2019m betting on Jack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-03T09:45:42-07:00","id":1485697,"title":"","content":"I don't think I've seen this J--- referred to as a &quot;he&quot; and didn't notice any male pronouns as &quot;him&quot; or &quot;his&quot;.<br /> Could this person be a JANE or a JULY, maybe?<br /> <br /> Also: I don't think J--- might stand for Jekyll, him being namedropped as one among the Mercers' forerunners: &quot;<span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Richard and I were always novices compared to Tesla, Edison, Jekyll, and Lidenbrock.</span></span></span>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27462,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27462-william-wilson","user":"William Wilson","date":". 07-03-2022, 12:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27462-william-wilson","name":"William Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-03T12:04:13-07:00","id":1485709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>William Wilson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1485397-tc-aether-serial?p=1485697#post1485697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think I've seen this J--- referred to as a &amp;quot;he&amp;quot; and didn't notice any male pronouns as &amp;quot;him&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;his&amp;quot;.<br /> Could this person be a JANE or a JULY, maybe?<br /> <br /> Also: I don't think J--- might stand for Jekyll, him being namedropped as one among the Mercers' forerunners: &amp;quot;<span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Richard and I were always novices compared to Tesla, Edison, Jekyll, and Lidenbrock.</span></span></span>&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Could be Jane. I just thought Jack cause of Safari Jack Tallon. I figured maybe he and Anne Mercer were friends.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-03T14:27:58-07:00","id":1485718,"title":"","content":"Crazy idea. What if the Mercers had a robot butler/bodyguard named Jabberwock?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-03T21:37:37-07:00","id":1485743,"title":"","content":"Jules - as Verne - seems fitting to the context of other people mentioned in text. \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-07T11:24:58-07:00","id":1485999,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/ii-what-fear-we-flame/\" target=\"_blank\">Part II</a> now up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-07T13:14:06-07:00","id":1486005,"title":"","content":"Huh...I'm just getting more and more confused about what exactly is the aether, energy? Chemical? Process? All of them? My pet theory is that it's some sort of refined flux.<br /> Also, I'm really eager to read the explanation as to why the invasion from Mars, and characters like Dr.Jekyll were dismissed as simple fiction. Some sort of aether backlash that changed the whole timeline?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-14T23:57:45-07:00","id":1486500,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/iii-no-sacrifice-too-great/\" target=\"_blank\">Part III</a>, in which our narrator is not impressed with all these self-experimenting scientists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-15T03:25:26-07:00","id":1486506,"title":"","content":"This sounds awesome!!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-15T04:06:15-07:00","id":1486508,"title":"","content":"While it was suggested we will not have playable martians in the core book, will we have playable monsters? We have vampires, werewolves and Frankstein Monster (probably, very likely) all in the list of adversaries, but can we play them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tom